00:21:04,846 --> 00:21:08,349
Oh, thank you. Thanks.
l owe you one, Dwight.

488
00:21:11,019 --> 00:21:12,103
Fire Jim.

489
00:21:12,187 --> 00:21:13,646
No.

490
00:21:13,730 --> 00:21:15,439
l'm cashing in
the favor, fire him.

491
00:21:15,524 --> 00:21:16,607
What are you talking. . .
Do it.

492
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:18,401
Promote me.
Tri-managers.

493
00:21:18,485 --> 00:21:19,527
Forget that.

494
00:21:19,611 --> 00:21:20,653
Can l have an office?
No.

495
00:21:20,737 --> 00:21:22,446
You know what, you can
keep your stupid favor.

496
00:21:22,531 --> 00:21:23,864
lt's worthless.

497
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:27,201
And this is my dinner on
your face, l'm keeping it.

498
00:21:28,036 --> 00:21:29,870
Oh, that feels better.

